Fly on the Pokemon that flies: in place of the generic bird, the Pokemon
doing the Fly on its overworld sprite of the follower's files (0056,
followers/mon/KEY.bin of the data pack), facing west with its walking
frames as wingbeats, through the same swoops out and in (the same sprite
callbacks, centred where the bird was). The player sits 4 pixels under the
top of its west-facing frame, over its middle (the bird's place for the
bird's own shape). The Pokemon is chosen in FldEff_UseFly from the party
slot the field effect uses and kept for the landing after the warp. The
bird where it has no sprite. The follower waits in its ball while Fly runs.
Applies after 0083-fly-3d-cinematic.patch; apply with tools/bootstrap.py.

